WEBVTT

00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:13.800
<i>A new kind of disease has been 
spreading among young people.</i>

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:17.280
<i>Following prolonged 
periods of Internet usage,</i>

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:23.420
<i>sufferers develop a pathological 
dependence on the Internet.</i>

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:28.210
<i>Experts have named this 
disease "Internet Addiction."</i>

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:34.890
<i>In order to get these addicted 
youngsters back on the right track</i>

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:39.130
<i>and reform them into independent, 
self-respecting adults,</i>

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:45.890
<i>the Elite Reeducation Academy,
a civilian educational facility, was created.</i>

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:53.740
<i>It is a place to help young 
people to grow up right.</i>

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:33.540
Episode 9
Evil Descending

00:02:27.570 --> 00:02:29.500
You want to work together?

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:31.600
If you try to do anything cowardly,

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:33.760
I'll end you right here.

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:37.310
I wouldn't do anything that transparent.

00:02:37.310 --> 00:02:39.520
You don't have to hold back.

00:02:40.020 --> 00:02:41.560
You don't need to take a fall.

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:43.510
I might not win.

00:02:43.780 --> 00:02:46.410
But I won't lose.

00:02:46.410 --> 00:02:48.600
Why don't we make a test out of this?

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:51.220
If I beat you on my own merits,

00:02:51.220 --> 00:02:54.100
will you think about working with me?

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:01.840
Why don't you show me how strong you are?

00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:05.310
You're my senpai.

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:09.490
So I hope for a good fight, Big Bro.

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:17.570
Oh, I forgot... you're "Big Sis," aren't you?

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:22.510
You're so tall, I forgot you were a woman.

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:25.040
The hell is he doing?

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:27.720
She's gonna beat the crap out of him...

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:27.720
He's gonna get it...

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:29.720
Has he gone crazy or something?

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:48.500
Going after her, despite his weakness...

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:50.340
He's tread on a tiger's tail.

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:52.020
Hoku, from our class,

00:03:52.020 --> 00:03:55.440
used to attend an athletics school, 
so she's better in a fight than most men.

00:03:55.440 --> 00:03:59.060
Head instructor, you might want 
to prepare a stretcher.

00:03:59.060 --> 00:04:00.640
I'm not interested in your opinion.

00:04:06.610 --> 00:04:10.290
Idiot. Acting so hot 
against someone stronger...

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:12.950
He probably just wanted 
to get to touch a woman.

00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:17.020
Having to run without dinner would be 
better than taking a beating like that...

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:20.860
A sexual harasser like 
him deserves a beating!

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:22.460
Die, you perv!

00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:24.180
Hoku, get him!

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:25.560
This is a trap.

00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:26.840
A trap?

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:28.170
Look at his legs!

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:30.020
He's taking all those hits,

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:31.150
but he's still on his feet.

00:04:31.150 --> 00:04:33.200
By bending and straightening his legs,

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:36.700
he's diffusing the power of Hoku's attacks.

00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:37.980
You're right.

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:41.160
She let him provoke her and got angry.

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:44.380
She's been keeping up those fierce 
attacks for five minutes now.

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:46.760
Her stamina must be at its limit.

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:49.180
Is that his plan?

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:55.250
<i>Not yet. I need... to hold out... 
just a little longer...</i>

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:13.140
You arrogant little bastard...

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:27.500
Hoku!

00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:29.000
Darling!

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:45.750
I lose.

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:47.030
I give up.

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:48.660
No way!

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:49.770
It can't be...

00:05:49.770 --> 00:05:50.490
You're kidding me!

00:05:51.090 --> 00:05:53.490
Th-That's impossible!

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:56.000
You coward! That was a low blow!

00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:57.500
Stop!

00:05:57.500 --> 00:06:00.640
I lost. This fight is over.

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:02.500
But... Hoku...

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:03.730
Hey...

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:05.510
What's going on?

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:07.510
You mean...

00:06:07.810 --> 00:06:09.760
We won't be punished!

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:09.510
He won!

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:11.090
We'll get to eat!

00:06:09.960 --> 00:06:11.760
He's amazing!

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:13.520
Incredible!

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:16.020
You tricky brat...

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:18.010
That was a dirty trick!

00:06:18.010 --> 00:06:19.690
He only just got here.

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:22.090
He hasn't learned kung-fu or the 
fundamentals of hand-to-hand combat.

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:23.600
What did you expect him to do?

00:06:23.600 --> 00:06:24.820
But, Head Instructor...

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:28.450
If you're still not satisfied, 
the two of us could spar.

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:30.490
It would serve as a fine 
example to the students.

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:32.510
Well...

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:35.490
No, no. I was being a sore loser...

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:38.780
<i>This is ridiculous! Spar? With him?</i>

00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:40.370
<i>He's a former narcotics investigator...</i>

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:44.460
<i>He's the man who beat every other instructor 
in sparring right after he got here.</i>

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:47.490
<i>He rose to the head instructor position 
so quickly because of his fighting skills!</i>

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:49.190
What are you muttering about?

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:54.000
I was thinking a little interaction between 
classes is nice to have now and then.

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:01.820
Things sound lively here.

00:07:01.820 --> 00:07:05.200
I think interaction between classes is 
a great way to give everyone a boost.

00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:07.700
But, Head Instructor Shian...

00:07:08.020 --> 00:07:14.350
I don't think a little fighting between 
class four students and girls is quite enough.

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:16.960
Even if they win, it's not exactly prestigious.

00:07:16.960 --> 00:07:21.730
While everyone's so excited, 
how about a competition with my class?

00:07:21.730 --> 00:07:24.840
Our class leader has been 
asking for it for a while.

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:27.690
Is that the leader of class six?

00:07:27.690 --> 00:07:30.380
What is that, high fashion? Cosplay?

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:32.570
Don't laugh, you guys!

00:07:32.570 --> 00:07:34.760
Yoh is the strongest guy here!

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:36.510
If you make him mad, you'll pay for it.

00:07:38.210 --> 00:07:41.940
Yoh was sent here for injuring opponents
 in hand-to-hand combat practice.

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:44.210
You want to pit him against a new student?

00:07:44.210 --> 00:07:45.700
Absolutely unacceptable.

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:47.560
He's not that good.

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:49.300
Head Instructor, you're 
making too much of it.

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:52.610
Though if it's reflective of your lack of faith 
in your students, that's another matter.

00:07:52.900 --> 00:07:56.500
It seems bullying girls is the only way 
you have of raising your profile...

00:08:00.490 --> 00:08:02.290
<i>What's going on here?</i>

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:05.000
<i>Why is Ryo flexing his 
muscles all of a sudden?</i>

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:09.250
<i>Why does Jean favor Shian?</i>

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:12.010
Instructor Ryo.

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:14.030
If you want to have fun with me,

00:08:14.030 --> 00:08:16.610
first I need to see if you have what it takes!

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:22.860
Bro Hyo is on my side!

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:24.100
Are you sure you should do this?

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:26.450
Shin's big brother is my patron.

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:28.530
You think I'm afraid of Hyo?

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:30.800
I'm sorry!

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:33.340
Please forgive me, Headmistress!

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:35.110
Get lost!

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:39.520
I'm going to drive you out of here, Shian.

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:43.600
<i>If Ryo came here to issue a challenge...</i>

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:46.290
<i>Does that mean there's infighting 
between the instructors, too?</i>

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:48.490
<i>I didn't anticipate this...</i>

00:08:48.490 --> 00:08:51.600
<i>I was so close to 
earning Shian's trust...</i>

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:53.500
<i>How can I get out of this?</i>

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:55.500
<i>Damn...</i>

00:08:55.810 --> 00:08:57.500
<i>I'll just have to try it!</i>

00:08:57.500 --> 00:08:59.120
Head Instructor.

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:01.900
If Yoh-senpai wants to do it,

00:09:01.900 --> 00:09:04.520
please let me compete with him.

00:09:05.090 --> 00:09:07.500
Our class are all newcomers.

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:10.250
We can't beat our senpais, 
who have been training for so long.

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:14.020
But I believe I have as much 
dedication as anyone else here.

00:09:15.980 --> 00:09:18.490
Is he serious?

00:09:19.970 --> 00:09:24.000
It seems the student has more 
backbone than the head instructor.

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:26.030
Don't get cocky!

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:28.080
Just because you beat a girl...

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:30.600
Head Instructor.

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:33.360
Why don't we respect his wishes?

00:09:33.360 --> 00:09:37.510
It's an excellent chance to teach 
him about differences in skill.

00:09:38.780 --> 00:09:39.500
Listen.

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:42.910
Instructor Ryo, I played games all the time,

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:45.180
and I don't know how to fight hand-to-hand.

00:09:45.590 --> 00:09:47.720
I haven't studied kung-fu yet, either,

00:09:47.720 --> 00:09:51.480
but I've been engaging earnestly 
with Head Instructor Shian's

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:53.380
strict training in the fundamentals.

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:56.020
Hey, you. What are you getting at?

00:09:56.250 --> 00:09:57.850
I have a proposal.

00:09:57.850 --> 00:10:01.490
I would like to challenge you 
to standing at attention.

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:10.390
That's a fine suggestion.

00:10:10.390 --> 00:10:11.500
I've no objection to it.

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:14.010
Okay! You'll compete in standing at attention!

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:17.520
<i>He's a crafty one...</i>

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:20.400
Standing at attention, eh?

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:24.710
No matter what tricks you attempt to employ,

00:10:24.710 --> 00:10:27.520
you're going to lose this challenge.

00:10:31.820 --> 00:10:35.400
Training to stand at attention 
fosters respect for rules

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:39.490
by encouraging strong will and dedication.

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:41.580
Listen, both of you.

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:45.500
Face each other, backs straight, chins up.

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:47.000
Eyes straight forward.

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:48.490
Faces still.

00:10:48.490 --> 00:10:50.030
Relax your shoulders,

00:10:50.030 --> 00:10:52.000
weight even on both legs.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:53.500
Chests up, stomachs in.

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:55.500
Arms hanging naturally,

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:57.500
legs straight.

00:10:57.500 --> 00:10:59.500
Fingers together at your sides.

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:00.960
Heels together,

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:03.010
feet at a 60 degree angle.

00:11:03.490 --> 00:11:06.620
Whoever moves first loses.

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:08.520
Begin!

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:18.730
All right, everyone.

00:11:18.730 --> 00:11:21.490
Yoh from class six and Hibiki from 
class four are on the athletic field

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:23.250
are competing in standing at attention.

00:11:23.250 --> 00:11:24.540
Go observe them!

00:11:35.200 --> 00:11:37.090
Which one will win?

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:39.280
Yoh never takes it easy on an opponent.

00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:40.700
You really think he'll lose?

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:47.560
Ten minutes have passed.

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:49.290
Even in a competition of 
standing at attention,

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:51.800
we all know who'll win.

00:12:54.090 --> 00:12:55.580
One hour has passed.

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:56.290
Are you kidding?

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:58.000
How long are they gonna stand there?

00:12:57.990 --> 00:12:59.580
Can't believe it.

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:59.590
Standing still for one hour...

00:13:01.020 --> 00:13:02.800
Not bad at all.

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:05.600
<i>Hibiki...</i>

00:13:31.050 --> 00:13:33.000
<i>I must not lose.</i>

00:13:33.900 --> 00:13:36.350
<i>I'm finally earning Shian's trust.</i>

00:13:36.350 --> 00:13:37.820
<i>If I blow it now,</i>

00:13:37.820 --> 00:13:42.580
<i>I'll be at a disadvantage in 
my upcoming fight with Shin.</i>

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:45.490
<i>How much time has passed?</i>

00:13:45.490 --> 00:13:47.680
<i>I didn't expect him to be this stubborn...</i>

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:51.390
<i>He looks frail, but he's certainly 
got a lot of determination...</i>

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:53.680
<i>This isn't good.</i>

00:13:54.090 --> 00:13:57.560
<i>If Yoh does lose, I'll be utterly humiliated.</i>

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:02.500
<i>I was trying to make trouble for Shian, 
but at this rate,</i>

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:04.570
<i>I'll be the one up against a wall...</i>

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:06.920
It's been three hours.

00:14:06.920 --> 00:14:09.600
I don't think either is 
going to admit their loss.

00:14:09.600 --> 00:14:12.530
If they continue, they'll both collapse.

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:13.960
Why don't we call it a draw?

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:16.260
<i>Damn...</i>

00:14:16.260 --> 00:14:19.580
<i>Wudo's gone already. If I lose Yoh, too...</i>

00:14:21.300 --> 00:14:23.680
Fair enough. You both did well.

00:14:23.680 --> 00:14:25.580
We'll call this a draw.

00:14:31.590 --> 00:14:33.560
This little brat...

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:35.680
<i>Humiliating me like this...</i>

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:45.380
Continue your training!

00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:45.380
Yes, sir!

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:48.990
Hibiki, you can go back to the dorm and rest.

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:51.380
Yes, Instructor.

00:14:55.800 --> 00:14:56.840
Um, Instructor.

00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:58.610
I'm in the same room as Hibiki.

00:14:58.610 --> 00:15:00.330
I'll take him there.

00:15:01.090 --> 00:15:02.290
Fine, go on.

00:15:06.490 --> 00:15:08.660
Hibiki-kun, are you okay?

00:15:08.660 --> 00:15:11.310
You were amazing. You didn't even budge.

00:15:11.310 --> 00:15:13.720
I was getting exhausted just watching you...

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:16.410
Despite how I look,

00:15:16.410 --> 00:15:18.330
I was a long-distance runner.

00:15:18.330 --> 00:15:22.000
If I lost in stamina, 
I really would be hopeless.

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:25.110
But Yoh doesn't just have power,

00:15:25.110 --> 00:15:27.100
he has endurance, too...

00:15:27.600 --> 00:15:31.070
Still, it was a draw, so it's over, right?

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:34.620
No, it's not over yet.

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:36.490
Bring me two buckets.

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:38.120
One with hot water, one with cold.

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:39.770
Um, water?

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:41.620
If you want to cool off, 
you should probably rest...

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:44.680
Shut up! Go and do it already!

00:15:44.680 --> 00:15:47.500
F-Fine! I-I'm going!

00:15:54.900 --> 00:15:57.720
Big Bro, we shouldn't go 
until you've had some rest.

00:15:57.720 --> 00:15:59.560
It's not like he's going anywhere...

00:15:59.760 --> 00:16:01.560
Shut up! Don't try to stop me!

00:16:09.180 --> 00:16:11.590
I brought your water.

00:16:12.790 --> 00:16:14.070
Okay.

00:16:16.680 --> 00:16:18.000
Hibiki!

00:16:21.880 --> 00:16:23.740
Is that you, Yoh-senpai?

00:16:23.740 --> 00:16:24.820
I'm so sorry.

00:16:24.820 --> 00:16:27.230
I asked my idiot friend here 
to fetch water for a bath,

00:16:27.230 --> 00:16:28.740
but he brought cold water instead.

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:34.520
I intended to throw the 
water out in annoyance.

00:16:34.520 --> 00:16:37.930
To think you'd happen to arrive just then...

00:16:38.190 --> 00:16:39.930
What the hell did you say?

00:16:42.160 --> 00:16:45.480
You were covered in cold water 
after working up such a sweat.

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:47.940
You should warm up with some warm water.

00:16:49.560 --> 00:16:52.010
H-Hey, Big Bro, you okay?

00:16:52.010 --> 00:16:53.950
Damn you!

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:57.330
What's going on?

00:16:57.330 --> 00:16:59.420
My body feels so heavy...

00:17:01.570 --> 00:17:03.360
I f-feel cold...

00:17:08.090 --> 00:17:10.900
You stood at attention so long,

00:17:10.900 --> 00:17:12.900
your stamina's at its limit.

00:17:12.900 --> 00:17:15.370
Getting hit with cold water followed 
by warm water, in your state,

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:17.310
will cause convulsions in your muscles.

00:17:17.320 --> 00:17:20.460
A significant shock will 
cause heart convulsions, too.

00:17:20.980 --> 00:17:23.820
You probably can't even stand right now...

00:17:24.510 --> 00:17:25.930
What did you say?

00:17:26.850 --> 00:17:27.930
Yoh-senpai.

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:32.440
Let's finish things now.

00:17:34.600 --> 00:17:35.770
Hey, Mei.

00:17:35.770 --> 00:17:37.880
Hibiki's stock has risen a lot 
since today's competition.

00:17:37.880 --> 00:17:39.780
Everyone in the class was impressed by him.

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:42.530
He might even take the leader spot from you.

00:17:42.530 --> 00:17:43.450
Shut up!

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:46.040
That little brat pissed Yoh off.

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:48.090
The class six guys won't 
take this lying down.

00:17:48.090 --> 00:17:49.960
They'll retaliate against us.

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:52.500
But knowing Yoh,

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:54.810
he's probably taking care 
of Hibiki right now.

00:17:54.810 --> 00:17:56.530
If we want to avoid retaliation ourselves,

00:17:56.530 --> 00:17:59.540
we should tell him that 
we're not with Hibiki.

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:03.380
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:05.700
Big Bro Yoh! Run away, fast!

00:18:05.700 --> 00:18:07.940
<i>Damn. I don't have any stamina left, either.</i>

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:10.510
<i>I can't even shake off this 
feeble henchman of his...</i>

00:18:10.890 --> 00:18:12.160
Hey, Mei!

00:18:12.160 --> 00:18:13.550
What are you standing there for?

00:18:13.550 --> 00:18:15.440
Do something about him right now!

00:18:17.460 --> 00:18:18.800
H-Hibiki!

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:20.320
Y-You hit Yoh-senpai?

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:21.240
Do you wanna die?!

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:23.690
Do you want to live under 
class six's thumb forever?

00:18:23.690 --> 00:18:25.880
If we take out Yoh, class six is finished!

00:18:26.240 --> 00:18:28.410
Do you really wanna waste this chance?

00:18:30.230 --> 00:18:32.550
What are you people scared of?

00:18:32.550 --> 00:18:34.410
Big Bro Yoh is in trouble!

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:37.580
If you help him now, 
everything goes back to normal!

00:18:37.900 --> 00:18:40.380
W-We're on Yoh-senpai's side!

00:18:40.380 --> 00:18:42.050
We're not with Hibiki!

00:18:43.250 --> 00:18:45.260
Then help us, quick!

00:18:55.190 --> 00:18:58.420
You're the dog who escaped out a tunnel!

00:18:58.420 --> 00:18:59.080
What are you doing?

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:02.020
I didn't escape out a tunnel!

00:19:02.020 --> 00:19:05.080
I'm not a dog! I'm Moku!

00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:09.580
I'm sick of this!

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:13.190
I'm sick of being called a 
dog and bullied by everyone!

00:19:14.440 --> 00:19:19.240
Now, I'm going to give 
you four one last chance.

00:19:19.240 --> 00:19:22.550
Will you be dogs, or will 
you stand tall as humans?

00:19:23.990 --> 00:19:26.700
Hibiki, stop trying to drive us apart.

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:28.710
Are you going to get us wrapped 
up in another of your messes?

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:31.120
Hey, there's no question, is there?

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:33.730
Vice Head Instructor Ryo 
is on Yoh-senpai's side.

00:19:34.010 --> 00:19:36.770
Doing what Yoh-senpai 
says is the safest route.

00:19:36.770 --> 00:19:38.520
Hibiki is just trash.

00:19:38.520 --> 00:19:40.220
He's always getting us dragged down with him.

00:19:40.220 --> 00:19:41.620
It doesn't matter if we're dogs or people.

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:45.080
The most important thing is staying safe.

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:48.210
Come on, let's all beat Hibiki together!

00:19:48.210 --> 00:19:49.250
Let's go!

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:50.080
Mei.

00:19:50.800 --> 00:19:54.180
I can see you're really not 
cut out to be our leader.

00:19:54.180 --> 00:19:56.100
Wh-What did you say?

00:19:56.100 --> 00:19:57.450
Get out of the way!

00:19:58.340 --> 00:20:02.460
Hibiki, we were really impressed 
by what you did today,

00:20:02.460 --> 00:20:04.480
but how is a class full of new students

00:20:04.480 --> 00:20:07.050
supposed to fight against 
established regulars like Yoh?

00:20:07.480 --> 00:20:09.160
It's simple.

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:11.490
I'll tell you right now.

00:20:13.090 --> 00:20:15.060
Watch very carefully.

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:18.810
Witness what happens to anyone

00:20:18.810 --> 00:20:23.070
who stands against me 
or mocks me from now on.

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:27.900
<i>Just wait, Shin.</i>

00:20:28.400 --> 00:20:31.900
<i>Next time... it's your turn.</i>

00:20:49.090 --> 00:20:51.300
What? Yui, was it?

00:20:51.300 --> 00:20:53.410
The mistress of that famous man?

00:20:53.410 --> 00:20:55.080
He's really something,

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:58.070
holding a big funeral like 
this for a mistress...

00:20:58.070 --> 00:21:01.590
Apparently, it was a painful death, 
because she was doing drugs.

00:21:02.210 --> 00:21:04.300
She probably deserved it.

00:21:04.300 --> 00:21:07.920
Enough. The boy is here. He'll hear you.

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:09.400
R-Right...

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:18.750
Hey, Shin.

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:20.820
The dead can't come back to life.

00:21:21.030 --> 00:21:22.360
Unfortunately.

00:21:23.690 --> 00:21:27.600
But our father's blood runs through our veins.

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:30.770
We're not the type to shed tears.

00:21:30.770 --> 00:21:33.400
Your mother's funeral is over.

00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:36.590
No need to feign being sad anymore.

00:21:37.980 --> 00:21:39.980
You're right, Big Brother.

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:41.070
Besides...

00:21:41.310 --> 00:21:43.720
the true culprit is standing right here.

00:21:44.090 --> 00:21:46.070
It's hard to feel like crying.

00:21:46.290 --> 00:21:50.790
Shin, has your mother's death driven you mad?

00:21:50.790 --> 00:21:55.010
Perhaps we should have you 
 committed for a while after all.

00:23:26.000 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:26.310 --> 00:23:28.340
Fine. I'll do as you say.

00:23:28.340 --> 00:23:29.990
Yes, Boss.

00:23:29.550 --> 00:23:32.510
I'd like to make full use of 
the time I have remaining.

00:23:30.980 --> 00:23:32.510
I'll be there soon.

00:23:34.030 --> 00:23:35.930
That's right.

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:39.760
Don't worry, this farce will be over soon.

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:40.020
Episode 10
Secrets to Be Hidden

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:38.900
My brother will help you, Hyo-san.
